{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32209","headline":"重游圭峰宗密禅师精庐 · 温庭筠","name":"重游圭峰宗密禅师精庐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"百尺青崖三尺坟，微言已绝杳难闻。\n戴顒今日称居士，支遁他年识领军。\n暂对杉松如结社，偶同麋鹿自成羣。\n故山弟子空廻首，葱岭唯应见宋云。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32209.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32209","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}